<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 11-14.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 11-14.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for April</p>
<p>11-14 at 1000GMT. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons</p>
<p>to a German mark.</p>
<p>	   April 11-14    April 10/11</p>
<p> CZK	0.46165     0.46352</p>
<p> DKK	2.10051     2.09976</p>
<p> FIM	2.67851     2.67966</p>
<p> HUF	0.07633     0.07631</p>
<p> JPY	0.10913     0.10877</p>
<p> LTL	3.4387	3.431</p>
<p> LVL     23.55476    23.50604</p>
<p> RUR	0.0024	0.00239</p>
<p> SEK	1.79042     1.78337</p>
<p> UAH	7.4471	7.40537</p>
<p> USD     13.7548     13.724</p>
<p> XEU     15.62752    15.62821</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
